## Student Registration and Login

### First Registration

The student registration flow is:

```text
Phone number
    |
    v
Request OTP
    |
    v
Kavenegar sends SMS
    |
    v
Verify OTP
    |
    v
Create authenticated Supabase user
    |
    v
Complete student profile
    |
    v
Set password
    |
    v
Registration complete
```

The student profile form contains:

* First name
* Last name
* Academic major
* Grade
* Province
* City
* Consultant name as free text

For later logins, the student uses:

* Phone number
* Password

Do not require OTP for every login.

Supabase Auth sessions must persist so the student does not need to log in again after every refresh or browser restart.

Never log:

* OTP codes
* Passwords
* Authentication tokens
* Session tokens

---

## Admin Login

Admins log in using:

* Email
* Password

Admin users are created manually by the developer in the Supabase Dashboard.

Public admin registration must not exist.

The frontend must not allow a student to convert their account into an admin account.

