## Admin Dashboard

Admins must be able to:

* View the student list
* Search students
* View student details
* View student profile information
* Upload private content for a selected student
* View uploaded student content
* Delete or archive student content
* Create exam-analysis content
* Edit exam-analysis content
* Publish or unpublish exam-analysis content

Admin access must be enforced by RLS and Edge Functions, not only by React route guards.

